	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Iam diu est (vir clarissime idemque pater in Christo <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>reverende), quod nihil ad pietatem tuam scribo.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quid scriberem, cum nihil habeam, quod eam oblectrae possit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Mitto tamen haec paucula legati regii, quae tu, si adhuc <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ignoras, scire potes et fortassis etiam desideras.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Tu schedam <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>hanc remitte, si commode potes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Expectatur ad diem Sauli <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Pauli, quando hic sunt futura comitia, sed minora illa, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>satis tamen pro rei qualitate frequentia, legatio (ut adhuc <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>audio) <placeName>Veneta</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Cupimus ex te scire transactionem illam <lb xml:id="p1z10"/><placeName ref="l176">Glaronensem</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Emi nuper bibliothecam <persName ref="p8431">Wolphgangi Saletii</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>ad quem te aliquando scripsisse ex literis comperi.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Inveni <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>schedas quasdam, quae continent ea, quae homini non fas profari.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Mitto ex illis quandoque ad dominum oratorem quaedam, quae continent <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>res <placeName>Gallicas</placeName> expiscaturus et ipse vicissim alia, quae aliquando <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>sint profutura.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Fuit is <persName ref="p8431">Saletius</persName> architriclinus episcopi <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><foreign xml:lang="de">(ein hoffmeister)</foreign> et simul scriba secretarius; sed et fuit <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>scriba Baionensis legati regii.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Hae sunt illę schedae (<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ut scis), quarum hic legatus meminit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Experior nunc, <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>quanti sit periculi omnia literis et schedis committere.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Rogo <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ergo te, si quaedam ad te scripsi primis illis annis aut etiam <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>postea, quae in vulgus prolata mihi incommodare aliquando <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>possent, ea tu concremare aut conscindere velis.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Plura non possum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Scribo haec festinantissime iam fractus tot <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>concionibus, quibus hosce dies simul faciendis occupatus sum.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Vale, reverende in Christo pater.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Opto, ut hic tibi annus <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>feliciter ineat, felicissime exeat.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> calendis ianuarii <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>1560.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/><persName ref="p8009">Ioannes Fabricius</persName> tu<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>i <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>observantissimus.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Es sol der jetzig nüwerwelt paapst, der dan <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>des alten castellanen von <placeName>Müß</placeName>, so die <placeName ref="l648">Pündter</placeName> bekrieget hat, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>bruͦder ist, ein schwester han gehan zuͦ <placeName ref="l3005">Under Ems</placeName>, daarumb die <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>post uff <placeName ref="l3005">Under Ems</placeName> gaat, das bättenbrott ze gewüne<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>n.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo viro eruditione <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>et pietate excellenti d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z4"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> antistiti <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>vigilantissimo, d. et <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>patrono suo <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>multum honorando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
